silm:instances_papers_19_mereology_as_colimit_chapters_flat_sections_06_closure_yoneda_hom_leg a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "ClosureYonedaHomLegExample" .
silm:instances_papers_19_mereology_as_colimit_chapters_flat_sections_06_closure_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'ClosureYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Section Closure (flat anchor)', the cocone_factorisation arrow witnesses a typed leg between Mittens and VetCarePlan_77 under the mereology-as-colimit law of the Mittens cocone with cocone-compatibility triangle closure.; also, In 'Section Closure (flat anchor)', the evidence_witness arrow witnesses a typed leg between VetRecord and Mittens under the mereology-as-colimit law of the Mittens cocone with cocone-compatibility triangle closure." .
